Relations: attaches to the order topic; `both` with `ORDER_CHANGE_REQUESTED`
Deal effect: none (Q26); proposed extra trigger for risk «Нет товара для поставки»', "updated_at" = now() WHERE "code" = 'SUBSTITUTION_REQUESTED';
